{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233520","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233520","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1423352001:1":{"text":"Jamie, Ms. Helina! How have you been?","source_cn":"詹米，胡丽诺女士，你们最近过得怎么样呀？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x483B6B98B6B64F1C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1423352002:1":{"text":"Jamie's been talking about you ever since you left. Go ahead, Jamie, say something to Miss Orlana.","source_cn":"自从你上次离开后，詹米一直念叨着你呢。詹米，跟欧罗娜小...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x420C455DEEDABECA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423352003:1":{"text":"... Miss Orlana.., I'm really happy to see you again. No one's ever given me a gift before...","source_cn":"……大姐姐，能再见到你……我好高兴！有人送我礼物，还是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D98432AE373010C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423352004:1":{"text":"I'm glad you liked it. Last time I only brought one book. This time, I brought a bunch. You can read them with your friends.","source_cn":"你喜欢就好！上次我只带了一本书，这次我给你带了好多书呢...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x507B202C00D34B39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423352005:1":{"text":"Thank you so much...","source_cn":"……大姐姐，谢谢你……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E32E6951A849070","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423352006:1":{"text":"Oh! These are Miss Florabelle and her students. They're here to learn about Sal'thorin.","source_cn":"对了！这是芙拉贝尔老师和她的学生，她们想了解和萨洛克兰...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09ECF708E2F0C93C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1423352007:1":{"text":"Hi, Jamie! I'm one of the Bulbsprites from the Vaduso Mountains!","source_cn":"詹米你好！我是来自瓦度索山脉的花灵！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1530CFA0D2BC51EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1423352007":{"text":"Hi, Jamie! I'm one of the Bulbsprites from the Vaduso Mountains!","source_cn":"詹米你好！我是来自瓦度索山脉的花灵！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1530CFA0D2BC51EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1423352008:1":{"text":"H-hi...","source_cn":"你、你好……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB704EF65C4A86B9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1423352009:1":{"text":"You've lived here your whole life, right Jamie? You probably know this area better than anyone.","source_cn":"詹米，你一直生活在这里，对这里的自然环境应该很熟悉吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB249DAAEABF30F86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1423352010:1":{"text":"Would you like to be our guide and show us around?","source_cn":"你愿意做我们的向导，带我们了解这里吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96CBFA6FEDBB0D0E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1423352011:1":{"text":"They're with Miss Orlana, so go ahead if you want to.","source_cn":"既然是跟欧罗娜小姐一起，你想去就去吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0C8797045E85BDE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1423352012:1":{"text":"I... I'd love to!","source_cn":"我……我愿意！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9226086CC295735C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1423352013:1":{"text":"Hehe, our little group just keeps growing.","source_cn":"嘿嘿，我们的队伍越来越壮大啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC225322164DED4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:0:1":{"text":"It's okay, Jamie. Don't be nervous.","source_cn":"别紧张，詹米","status":"matched_runt